--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 75e7bea227aaf2b499307efe1ddc0480, type: 3}
  m_Name: CartaDialog
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::NPCDialog
  NPCName: Carta
  DialogLines:
  - text: "Chief\u2026 good timing!"
    isQuestion: 0
    choices: []
  - text: "The data storm wiped half of our district\u2019s inventory ledgers."
    isQuestion: 0
    choices: []
  - text: "Shops can still trade, but they\u2019ve forgotten what travelers were
      preparing to collect."
    isQuestion: 0
    choices: []
  - text: "Some people had parts lists, supply slates\u2026 plans for what they wanted
      to gather."
    isQuestion: 0
    choices: []
  - text: "If you\u2019re rebuilding the town\u2019s systems, I can restore a feature
      that remembers those lists between visits."
    isQuestion: 0
    choices: []
  - text: It would let the markets recall what a traveler was collecting the last
      time they were here.
    isQuestion: 1
    choices:
    - choiceText: Restore that memory.
      nextDialogIndex: 6
    - choiceText: Leave it manual.
      nextDialogIndex: 7
  - text: "Understood. I\u2019ll reconnect the market ledgers to the town\u2019s
      memory system."
    isQuestion: 0
    choices: []
  - text: Fair enough. Some travelers prefer to keep their own records.
    isQuestion: 0
    choices: []
